  "title": "P&G Accessibility Statement",
  "description": "Learn how Procter & Gamble supports digital inclusion through accessible web design, assistive technology compatibility, and WCAG compliance. Find accessibility features, testing practices, and contact options for people with disabilities.\nProcter & Gamble is committed to digital inclusion and accessible web design. Learn about P&G’s accessibility practices, WCAG-aligned testing, assistive technology support, and how people with disabilities can contact us for help or feedback.",
